cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
terminal.1	1	terminal	lay out					where lay out is handed that standard output is not a terminal, a level is written as MTSV text by the generator
terminal.2	1	terminal	lay out					where standard output is a terminal, each sheet begins on a page of its own, its header in bold, each field padded to its column's widest, joined by the column gap
terminal.3	1	terminal	lay out					a wide or fullwidth character takes two columns
terminal.4	1	terminal	lay out					bold is set and reset by select graphic rendition, with the parameters 1 and 0
terminal.5	1	terminal	lay out					a control character in a field is written as its control picture
terminal.6	1	void-os	void-os			true		the text is written on standard output in UTF-8, the activity's blocks among it
terminal.7	1	terminal	page					the text is piped, in UTF-8, through the command the pager variable holds, run as the command string of sh -c
